{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：「到那時，人必將猶大王的骸骨和他首領的骸骨、祭司的骸骨、先知的骸骨，並耶路撒冷居民的骸骨，都從墳墓中取出來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拋散在日頭、月亮，和天上眾星之下，就是他們從前所喜愛、所事奉、所隨從、所求問、所敬拜的。這些骸骨不再收殮，不再葬埋，必在地面上成為糞土；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["並且這惡族所剩下的民在我所趕他們到的各處，寧可揀死不揀生。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["罪與罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你要對他們說，耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人跌倒，不再起來嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人轉去，不再轉來嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這耶路撒冷的民，為何恆久背道呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們守定詭詐，不肯回頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我留心聽，聽見他們說不正直的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人悔改惡行，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我做的是甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們各人轉奔己路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如馬直闖戰場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的鸛鳥知道來去的定期；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斑鳩燕子與白鶴也守候當來的時令；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓卻不知道耶和華的法則。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你們怎麼說：我們有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的律法在我們這裏？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，文士的假筆舞弄虛假。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人慚愧，驚惶，被擒拿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們棄掉耶和華的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裏還有甚麼智慧呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我必將他們的妻子給別人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他們的田地給別人為業；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們從最小的到至大的都一味地貪婪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從先知到祭司都行事虛謊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們輕輕忽忽地醫治我百姓的損傷，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安了！平安了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實沒有平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們行可憎的事知道慚愧嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，他們毫不慚愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不知羞恥。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此他們必在仆倒的人中仆倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向他們討罪的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必致跌倒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：我必使他們全然滅絕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄樹上必沒有葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無花果樹上必沒有果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葉子也必枯乾。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所賜給他們的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必離開他們過去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"我們為何靜坐不動呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們當聚集，進入堅固城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裏靜默不言；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華－我們的上帝使我們靜默不言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又將苦膽水給我們喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都因我們得罪了耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們指望平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻得不着好處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望痊癒的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不料，受了驚惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"聽見從但那裏敵人的馬噴鼻氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的壯馬發嘶聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全地就都震動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們來吞滅這地和其上所有的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞滅這城與其中的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"看哪，我必使毒蛇到你們中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是不服法術的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必咬你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米為同胞悲傷"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"我有憂愁，願能自慰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心在我裏面發昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，是我百姓的哀聲從極遠之地而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：耶和華不在錫安嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的王不在其中嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：他們為甚麼以雕刻的偶像","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和外邦虛無的神惹我發怒呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麥秋已過，夏令已完，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們還未得救！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知說：因我百姓的損傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也受了損傷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我哀痛，驚惶將我抓住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"在基列豈沒有乳香呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裏豈沒有醫生呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我百姓為何不得痊癒呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}